# (1.4.3, the user's: "the intros and outros themselves are quiet, so a hand-over is quiet too"; and a Segue from the
# next piece's second phrase, as a Mix; build/design/REPORT-introoutro.txt) Each bar's loudness, K-weighted, against
# the main's median bar (lvwatch: lvin the intro's level, lvin4 its first 4 bars', lvu10 its bars more than 10 LU
# under, lvout the outro's, lvoutend its last 8 bars'; LU x10). The classics' intros (build/research/dubtechno,
# 50 with one of 8 bars or more): 3 bars more than 10 under (the median), the first 4 bars -11.5 dB, then -6.8, -3.8;
# their outros' last 32 bars -0.8 -1.5 -2.1 -2.4 -5.7 -6.5 -10.2 -20.1 dB, 4 bars each.
# Before (this take): Haze's intro 8 bars more than 10 LU under, its first 4 -37.7 LU, the whole -2.9; its outro
# -5.2, its last 8 bars -10.1; a Segue into Haze: the hole 3.8 s, the lowest -16.5 LU, its kick in at 155 sixteenths
# (bar 9.7), its bass at 232 (14.5).
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 1500
# 1. Haze, an Ambient intro, as a song plays it (LP's too): Intro 32 bars, Main 32, Outro 32
turn PRESET 7 5
wait 800
expect piece 7
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 28
spin K1 1
wait 300
expect par158 1
tap HOME
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
spin K2 -16
wait 300
expect par159 4
expect par160 4
expect par161 4
tap PLAY
wait 300
lvwatch
# 96 bars at 116: 198.6 s
wait 203000
expect playing 0
# (before: 8 bars, -37.7 LU, -2.9, -5.2, -10.1; this take's kick in at bar 4, faded over 3: 7 bars under)
expect lvu10 <8
expect lvin4 >-260
expect lvin >-22
expect lvout >-42
expect lvoutend >-85
# 2. Pressure, a Pulse intro: its first bars in at once (the kick and the bass over a bar or two, not four)
turn PRESET -1
wait 800
expect piece 6
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 28
tap HOME
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
spin K2 -16
wait 300
expect par160 4
tap PLAY
wait 300
lvwatch
# 96 bars at 126: 182.9 s
wait 187000
expect playing 0
# (before: -5.1 LU, -3.2, -12.0)
expect lvu10 <2
expect lvin4 >-49
expect lvout >-26
expect lvoutend >-116
# 3. a Segue, Pressure (Intro None, Main 32, Outro 16) into Haze: Haze from its second phrase, its kick and its bass
# from the downbeat under the held echo, its chord once the hold lets go (bar 2: 32 sixteenths)
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 28
spin K1 1
wait 300
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect par158 2
expect trans 1
tap HOME
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 27
spin K1 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect par159 0
expect par160 4
expect par161 2
tap PLAY
wait 300
trwatch
lvwatch
# Pressure's 48 bars at 126: 91.4 s; Haze's 40 at 116: 82.8 s
wait 176000
expect piece 7
expect trrestarts 1
expect trhole <1600
expect trlow >-120
expect trkick <16
expect trbass <48
expect trchord >31
expect trchord <48
expect trquiet <500
expect trclick <110
# (before: 3 bars, -2.8 LU)
expect lvu10 <2
expect lvin >-18
